          "text": "**Considering credible sources**\n\nI’ll include several reputable sources for this task. The Office of the Clerk will provide official government primary vote data, and Congress.gov offers a primary legislative record. I definitely want to incorporate the ACLU scorecard, which is widely respected for its transparent methodology. \n\nRegarding the Human Rights Campaign scorecard, it seems better to cite it only if we have specific Jeffries-related numbers. Including it could demonstrate support for general legislative values, but I’ll prioritize the ACLU score for its strong endorsement.",
