        },
        {
          "text": "**Finding specific vote details**\n\nI need to ensure I find a Jeffries-specific \"yes\" vote. The Clerk page does include his overall voting record, but it doesn't display his name clearly, which might confuse the user. It’s fine to cite the Clerk page since it serves as the official roll call, confirming he voted \"Yea.\" However, since users might not easily check for his individual vote, I'll also look for confirmation of his vote on UFLPA from VoteSmart. Let’s search for that now!",
